  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"><strong>Promote wearable glass art from one of the world's most collected sculptors — and earn on every referral.</strong></p><p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\">One creator made a single YouTube video about Jack's flagship pendant, The Bliss. In under 60 days, that one video drove nearly <strong>$140,000 in sales</strong> and earned the affiliate close to<strong> $15,000 in commission</strong>. That's the kind of audience-product fit you don't find in most programs.</p><p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\">Jack Storms is a world-renowned cold-fusion glass sculptor whose work sits in private collections around the world. The wearables line brings that same craftsmanship into pieces your audience can wear every day — handcrafted, deeply intentional, and unlike anything else in the market. The Bliss, the founding piece of the Frequency Line, is the only frequency-imprinted pendant in the collection, and it's the piece audiences connect with most.</p><p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"><strong>Here's what you earn:</strong></p><ul class=\"[li_&amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3\"><li class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\"><strong>10% commission</strong></li><li class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\"><strong>180-day cookie window</strong> — you get credit long after the click</li><li class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\"><strong>15% discount code</strong> for your audience (our best public offer, always — no campaign undercuts it)</li><li class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\"><strong>Bi-weekly payouts </strong>with no lead time as there is no refund policy</li><li class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\"><strong>Gifted piece program</strong> available for qualifying creators</li></ul><p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"><strong>Who this works for: </strong>Creators in conscious living, spiritual practice, mindful luxury, frequency and sound work, slow craft, and intentional living. If your audience values pieces with story and meaning, this catalog converts — and the numbers above prove it.</p><p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\">Join now!</p></div>",
